            <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
              <name>DateOfRecognition</name>
              <id>988</id>
              <visible>true</visible>
              <enabled>true</enabled>
              <userVisible>
                <common>true</common>
              </userVisible>
              <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
                <segments>Object.DateOfRecognition</segments>
              </dataPath>
              <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
              <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
              <extendedTooltip>
                <name>DateOfRecognitionExtendedTooltip</name>
                <id>990</id>
                <title>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>The &lt;b>From document date&lt;/> mode is used for planned initial recognition.
The &lt;b>From previous date&lt;/> mode is used for initial recognition of fixed assets if source document were received late.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>حالت &lt;b>از تاریخ سند&lt;/> برای شناسایی اولیه برنامه‌ریزی‌شده استفاده می‌شود.
حالت &lt;b>از تاریخ قبلی&lt;/> برای شناسایی اولیه دارایی‌های ثابت در صورت دریافت دیرهنگام سند منبع استفاده می‌شود.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Режим &lt;b>С даты документа&lt;/> используется для принятия к учету в плановом порядке.
Режим &lt;b>С прошлой даты&lt;/> используется для принятия к учету ОС, в случае позднего получения первичных документов.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>&lt;b>Belge tarihli&lt;/> modu, planlandığı gibi muhasebeleştirmek için kullanılmaktadır.
&lt;b>Geçmiş tarihli&lt;/> modu, birincil belgelerin geç alınması durumunda sabit kıymetlerin muhasebeleştirilmesi için kullanılmaktadır.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Chế độ &lt;b>Từ ngày chứng từ&lt;/> được sử dụng để tiếp nhận vào kế toán như dự tính.
Chế độ &lt;b>Từ ngày trước&lt;/> được sử dụng để tiếp nhận vào kế toán TCSĐ, trong trường hợp nhận hồ sơ gốc muộn hơn.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>The &lt;b>From document date&lt;/> mode is used for planned initial recognition.
The &lt;b>From previous date&lt;/> mode is used for initial recognition of fixed assets if source document were received late.</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>The &lt;b>From document date&lt;/> mode is used for planned initial recognition.
The &lt;b>From previous date&lt;/> mode is used for initial recognition of fixed assets if source document were received late.</value>
                </title>
                <formatted>true</formatted>
                <type>Label</type>
                <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
                <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
                <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                  <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
                </extInfo>
              </extendedTooltip>
