          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>DepreciationAdjustmentOption</name>
            <id>1030</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Additional depreciation accrual</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>محاسبه تکمیلی استهلاک</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Доначисление амортизации</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>İlave amortismanın eklenmesi</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Tính bổ sung khấu hao</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Additional depreciation accrual</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Additional depreciation accrual</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>Object.DepreciationAdjustmentOption</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>DepreciationAdjustmentOptionOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>DepreciationAdjustmentOptionExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>1032</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>You can use the &lt;b>Automatically (when calculating depreciation)&lt;/> mode if there were no events in the past that changed the cost or depreciation (for example, appreciation, write-off, or revaluation).
If there were such events, perform additional accrual manually and specify how the cost or depreciation changed in the adjustment.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>در صورتی می‌توانید از حالت &lt;b>خودکار (هنگام محاسبه استهلاک)&lt;/> استفاده کنید که در گذشته رویدادی که بهای تمام‌شده یا استهلاک را تغییر دهد (برای مثال، افزایش ارزش، اسقاط یا تجدید ارزیابی) وجود نداشته است.
اگر چنین رویدادهایی وجود داشته‌اند، محاسبه تکمیلی را به‌صورت دستی انجام داده و نحوه تغییر بهای تمام‌شده یا استهلاک را در تعدیل مشخص کنید.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Режим &lt;b>Автоматически (при расчете амортизации)&lt;/> можно использовать, если в прошлом не было событий, меняющих стоимость или амортизацию (например, модернизация, списание, переоценка).
Если такие события были, то доначисление необходимо выполнять вручную, указав в корректировке как изменялась стоимость или амортизация.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Otomatik (amortisman hesaplanırken)&lt;/> modu&lt;b>, geçmişte maliyeti veya amortismanı değiştiren herhangi bir olay olmadıysa (örneğin modernizasyon, gider yazma, yeniden değerleme) kullanılabilir. 
Bu tür olaylar gerçekleşmişse, düzeltme işleminde maliyetin veya amortismanın nasıl değiştiği belirtilerek ek tahakkukun manuel olarak yapılması gerekir</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Chế độ &lt;b>Tự động (khi hạch toán khấu hao)&lt;/> có thể sử dụng nếu trước đây chưa có sự kiện mà thay đổi giá trị hoặc khấu hao (ví dụ, nâng cấp, ghi giảm, đánh giá lại).
Nếu có các sự kiện như vậy thì cần tính bổ sung thủ công bằng cách chỉ ra giá trị hoặc khấu hao đã thay đổi như thế nào trong điều chỉnh.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>You can use the &lt;b>Automatically (when calculating depreciation)&lt;/> mode if there were no events in the past that changed the cost or depreciation (for example, appreciation, write-off, or revaluation).
If there were such events, perform additional accrual manually and specify how the cost or depreciation changed in the adjustment.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>You can use the &lt;b>Automatically (when calculating depreciation)&lt;/> mode if there were no events in the past that changed the cost or depreciation (for example, appreciation, write-off, or revaluation).
If there were such events, perform additional accrual manually and specify how the cost or depreciation changed in the adjustment.</value>
              </title>
              <formatted>true</formatted>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>DepreciationAdjustmentOptionContextMenu</name>
              <id>1031</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
            <type>InputField</type>
            <editMode>Enter</editMode>
            <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
            <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
            <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:InputFieldExtInfo">
              <maxWidth>28</maxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <wrap>true</wrap>
              <listChoiceMode>true</listChoiceMode>
              <chooseType>true</chooseType>
              <typeDomainEnabled>true</typeDomainEnabled>
              <textEdit>true</textEdit>
              <choiceList>
                <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
                  <value>Enum.AdditionalDepreciationAccrualOptions.EnumValue.Automatically</value>
                </value>
              </choiceList>
              <choiceList>
